# base44

> JavaScript shelf for Base44. Sister of base44-projects and the many Base44 apps.

## Purpose
Give a plain-language door to fitzyracing1/base44.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the original repo as the Base44 core shelf.
2. Use this clone to explain the idea.
3. Send the reader to named apps (fixerup, market-connect, earthmobile) when they want a product.

## Key ideas
- Base44 (the named platform shelf)
- JavaScript source

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/base44
open_source()
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. open_source() → “go to fitzyracing1/base44”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader wants the project list → base44-projects
- If a reader wants this core → stay on the source

## What a person would notice
A named wrap on the Base44 door.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the source.
